    "summary": "As your Movement phase finishes, Feirros can pick one ADEPTUS ASTARTES VEHICLE model from your army within 3″ of him. It heals 3 wounds. The same model may ignore modifiers to Movement and Ballistic Skill. It can also disregard modifiers on Hit rolls or Wound rolls. Both permissions end when your next Movement phase begins.",
